{"unit_id":"tag:03Y5:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本章介绍代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）上的一些拓扑（topologies）。可与<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>及<REF_0004>中的内容比较。在此之前，我们想指出，位点（sites）（定义见《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0005>）有许多不同的选择，它们在底层范畴（underlying category）上给出相同的层（sheaf）概念。因此，我们的选择可能与所引文献中的略有不同，但最终得到相同的上同调群（cohomology groups）等。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本章的对象；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"代数空间的范畴；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"范畴上引入的拓扑；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"给出相同层概念的位点；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"章节标题；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"位点的底层范畴；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"位点上的层；所供词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"不同选择给出相同的上同调群；所供词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
